{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：08:40 2026-10-21 HKT<br/>發佈時間：08:40 2026-10-21 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：08:40 2026-10-21 HKT</p><img alt=\"fb馬路的事 (即時交通資訊台)圖片\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5bdfe7510ece249cd50cb38222dffdf6/2026-10/page_156.jpg\"/><p>今日（21日）早上近8時，一輛載有學童的學校小巴沿西區海底隧道往港島方向行駛，當駛至近隧道入口時，在快線與一輛客貨車相撞。救援人員接報到場，客貨車司機腳部受傷，校巴上則無人受傷，事故原因有待調查。</p><img alt=\"fb馬路的事 (即時交通資訊台)圖片\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/773a2e3f36b3b4147b863dba4b5bd7d0/2026-10/1_10_8.jpg\" title=\"fb馬路的事 (即時交通資訊台)圖片\"/><p>fb馬路的事 (即時交通資訊台)圖片</p><p></p><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-21T01:30:44.257164+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":200,"images":2,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-21T00:40:01+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-21T04:37:53.059633+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-21T01:28:17.738059+00:00","content_hash":"edc1aafd3c7ad14f8529581a76a7bfbdc7bf62ccc2c12f91760f28af26cf2d7c","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}